{"info": {"address1": "401-407, Nirman Vyapar Kendra", "address2": "Plot No. 10, Sector 17 Vashi", "city": "Navi Mumbai", "zip": "400703", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6794 6600", "fax": "91 22 6794 6666", "website": "https://alkylamines.com", "industry": "Specialty Chemicals", "industryKey": "specialty-chemicals", "industryDisp": "Specialty Chemicals", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Alkyl Amines Chemicals Limited manufactures and supplies amines, amine derivatives, and other specialty chemicals in India and internationally. The company offers aliphatic amines, such as methylamines, ethylamines, isopropylamines, n-propylamines, n-butylamines, ethylhexylamines, furfurylamines, and cyclohexylamines; and amine derivatives, including dimethylamine hydrochloride, diethylamine hydrochloride, triethylamine hydrochloride, 3-ethoxy propylamine, 3-(methylaminopropyl) amine, dimethylaminopropylamine, 3-(2-ethylhexyloxy) propylamine, n-methylbenzylamine, diisopropyl ethylamine, diethylhydroxylamine, diethyl toluamide, and diethylphenyl acetamide. It also provides specialty chemicals comprising acetonitrile, 1,8-diazabicyclo[5.4.0]undec-7-ene, diethylketone/3-pentanone, alchan 100, alchan 300, 2-aminoethoxy ethanol, 2-ethoxy ethylamine, dimethylpropyleneurea, tetramethyl ethylenediamine, monomethylamine, and tempo free radical. The company serves pharmaceutical, agro-chemicals, water treatment chemicals, rubber chemicals, and other industries. Alkyl Amines Chemicals Limited was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Navi Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 686, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Yogesh Mathradas Kothari", "age": 76, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1949, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 144516000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rakesh S. Goyal", "age": 58, "title": "Whole-time Director - Operations", "year